  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PASMIF2 Mikrokreditprogram lett av UNDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PASMIF2 microcredit program led by UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation and development of new financial products. Design of       micro-financing tools that benefit the poorest in rural areas of      DRC&apos;s poorest provinces such as Equateur. Capacity building among     micro-financing institutions. PASMIF2 program is led by UNDP and      UNCDF. German bank KfW and the Worldbank also participate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ta fram nya financiella produkter. Design av mikrofinansverktyg som   gynnar de fattigaste p&#xe5; landsbygden i landets fattigaste provinser    som Equateur. Kapacitetsuppbyggnad bland mikrofinansinstitutioner.    PASMIF2-programmet leds av UNDP och UNCDF samt tyska banken KfW och   V&#xe4;rldsbanken.</narrative>
  </description>
